0, at 915 MHz): 0.61 mW/cm^2 general public, 3.05 mW/cm^2 occupational, averaged 30 min.␀It's an estimate, good to a few dB: antenna gain, the board's front-end and reflections all move it. The receiver␀tops out near 0 dBm, so right beside a meter it reads LOW (you'll see OVERLOAD). For a signed-off number use a␀calibrated broadband RF exposure meter. Meters and their ICMs are FCC-certified to meet these limits at 20 cm.␀ffaa5500␀ffaaaa00␀ff00aa00␀ff55ffff␀ff0000aa␀<2␀2-5␀5-10␀10-20␀20-50␀50-100␀100-250␀250+␀IP address␀MAC address␀Ping (ms)␀Maker / note␀Raspberry Pi␀ESP32 board␀Apple␀Amazon␀Google␀Roku␀Microsoft VM␀TP-Link␀Synology␀Withings␀Nest␀Pencil␀Brush␀Eraser␀Spray␀Line␀Box␀Filled box␀Oval␀Filled oval␀Paint fill␀Wireless mesh␀Blue light␀power on␀external pin␀crash␀crash (interrupt)␀crash (task)␀watchdog␀deep sleep␀low voltage (brownout)␀SDIO␀Running␀Ready␀Waiting␀Paused␀Ending␀Performance␀Apps␀Tasks␀Storage␀Power & info␀loopTask␀TidyOS desktop and apps␀IDLE␀Idle (free time)␀IDLE0␀Idle core 0␀IDLE1␀Idle core 1␀nimble_host␀Bluetooth host␀btController␀Bluetooth radio␀Keyboard/mouse manager␀CPU test (core 0)␀CPU test (core 1)␀keyrep␀Key repeat␀serkbd␀Serial keyboard␀wifi␀Wi-Fi driver␀tiT␀TCP/IP network␀sys_evt␀System events␀esp_timer␀System timers␀Tmr Svc␀Timer service␀ipc0␀Core 0 helper␀ipc1␀Core 1 helper␀shelfmsg␀Shelf messaging + mesh␀fileweb␀File sharing server␀fetch␀Browser download␀Blue status light␀Printing␀findprn␀Printer search␀mdns␀.local name␀Router ping␀msgadd␀Shelf lookup␀FabGL␀Screen drawing␀Water␀Food␀Firewood␀Fuel␀People␀Water (gal)␀Food (days)␀Firewood (armloads)␀Armloads per day␀Fuel (gal)␀Fuel per day␀Water stored (gallons)␀Food on hand (days of meals)␀Armloads burned per day␀Fuel (gallons gas/propane)␀Fuel used per day (gallons)␀If this happens␀Field guide␀How long can we last?␀Centre␀Blue␀Gray␀Red␀Green␀Teal␀Dark gray␀7␀␀␀Sj<Zj<sj<yj<”j<šj< j<§j<Äj<Ðj<çj<îj<k<k<$k<-k<Dk<Mk<Sk<]k<vk<…k<Œk<“k<™k<Ÿk<§k<±k<ºk<Âk<Èk